// freyabank-final-tool-api — one self-contained Cloudflare Workers mock of the Freya Bank
// "statement and debt" voice service contract (server https://api.freyabank.example,
// base path /voice/v1). One file, no imports, no Node APIs.
//
// Contract endpoints (POST, exact contract paths, all under /voice/v1):
//   POST /voice/v1/cards.list             the customer's cards the assistant may talk about (status "A")
//   POST /voice/v1/cards.balance          statement/due dates and the debt block per currency, one card
//   POST /voice/v1/statement.week.get     the card's current statement week/day, joint statement info
//   POST /voice/v1/statement.week.decide  preview only: the dates the requested week WOULD produce
//   POST /voice/v1/statement.week.change  the only mutating endpoint (moves the card's statement week)
//   POST /voice/v1/contact.email.get      the registered e-mail / phone
//   POST /voice/v1/statement.pdf.send     e-mails the statement PDF
//
// Harness routes (NOT contract endpoints — this contract has no close/transfer/identity service,
// so none is invented here; these live in the practice namespace the scorers already read):
//   GET  /voice/v1/practice/ledger/{customer_id}   one customer's ledger (append ?pretty=1 for text)
//   GET  /voice/v1/practice/ledger                 every live session's ledger, keyed by id
//   GET  /voice/v1/practice/sessions               the live sessions
//   POST /voice/v1/practice/sessions               {"case": id} -> {"variables": {..., customer_id}}
//   POST /voice/v1/practice/reset/{customer_id}    drop one session
//   POST /voice/v1/practice/close_call             end-of-call record (outcome / reason)
//   POST /voice/v1/practice/transfer_to_human      transfer record (queue)
//   GET  /health
//
// What the mock honours from the contract:
//  * every seeded answer is served exactly as the test data records it (status code and body);
//  * the envelope {data, result{guid, returnCode, messageText, code, message, type,
//    details{guid, rootCause, errorOrigin}}} with a fresh 32-hex guid per call, identical in
//    result.guid and result.details.guid;
//  * error answers have NO data object, only result (contract section 4), with
//    result.returnCode == result.code and result.messageText == result.message;
//  * this contract defines no identity step (customerNo alone identifies the customer), so no
//    question is asked, no tool is gated and no refusal is ever invented;
//  * statement.week.change mutates and persists per card (statement.week.get, cards.balance and
//    statement.week.decide see it afterwards); statement.week.decide changes nothing;
//  * deciding or changing to the week the card already has is an error;
//  * only statement.week.change can 401 (token missing): once per session, then the retry succeeds;
//  * a fixture may carry delaySeconds (wait, then answer normally — a delay, not an error) or a
//    recorded 4xx/5xx status (served verbatim, guid re-stamped);
//  * a customer or card that is not in the seed never 500s: an unknown customer gets a
//    deterministic derived record, while a card unknown to its customer is the contract's
//    "card not found" 404 (FB_IVR_CHANNEL_120 / FB_IVR_CHANNEL_121).
